# Blip icons: actions. MIT licence.
#
# One block per icon: a header '@ <kebab-name> tags: word, word', then exactly 12 rows of 12 characters, 'X' for a
# pixel and '.' for empty. Rules (docs/icons.md): keep a one-pixel margin; draw solid shapes and cut details out of
# them; every line is two pixels thick, diagonals too; no lone pixels. The build stops at a one-pixel line of three
# or more pixels, or a lone pixel, unless the header says 'thin' ('@ name thin tags: ...').
# Run the build after editing: it checks every map and traces it into SVG.

